{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7185b32ce7fdf73730f8b4b9e5ec49c48944213c5fdac832c687921638b32cd",
      "text": "因为……心底诞生了某种感情，\n这件事本身，我认为就足够美好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5310a0b49574e6fee8c08b810e125df70143f511591067ff823d87616dd9a41",
      "text": "喜悦、悲伤、感动、愤怒……\n心中无法诞生任何感情的人类，和死人没有任何分别。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27ce19c49067f16c8a241907ea2e5925096fb2994c46f9bf38e1811d24dfe667",
      "text": "比起那种寂静，\n我更想侧耳倾听心灵泛起涟漪的奇迹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea9a4a09f3e4be4d7a37588f5ae5e336822ba130421b9e6e5f8eb20cba64fc0",
      "text": "……我们拿到的这首歌，\n也是将那样的奇迹化作了音符呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a5020b089859328f693f150055bcaa3d1cea28a093a146478e00b82a54b673c",
      "text": "……嗯。无论看多少次资料，\n都觉得这是一首凄楚、脆弱……而又美丽动人的歌呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1c4dc353c08255a1e35b0a06b9a3a66281a5553ecd51e5b9be97d8794c01867",
      "text": "真想快点唱唱看啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92f7672fa34f611cbb3cc6a32f43d695ba66a000d25dbb0400c9dff0aae776c4",
      "text": "我也……是这么想的。\n从刚拿到这首歌的时候起……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a75931fc730ac2a1f64d6a6015b0c4319dcd6ec239ebcf16b67ad793707e182",
      "text": "……花园。不用去管对方会有什么反应。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f0c64046ab9d1e1976e2f67f600bf3192412dd40f85afe677436ad06088dac3",
      "text": "就算那件事对某些人来说不太方便……\n但能有想做的事情，本身就是一件好事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bacdf5d87ea44a462ef5ff9fd408a0c9d26f5e31c1007f1f88f16979f21745c",
      "text": "那些想做的事，不正是\n你想活出自我、活得像自己的证明吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c3bc141883a8077caeb0c7ef9c96d81f51d04ac3d44279a28e036a1213a9b6d",
      "text": "商讨辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba6d317ce3a2bfaf3d87ba426113b0a3498828395ba8d093265eb3539b78c491",
      "text": "辛苦了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000128:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d6887ba228df48903dd9c7791b34690f9d734631ddaed6dd8c95555f5caf53c",
      "text": "明天就是广告拍摄了呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000130:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28581383e7a4cbb59273f2332b7f0d84ada61a975e6edb936ce4ce2822d04f67",
      "text": "多亏了连日的商讨，\n我觉得自己差不多\n找到感觉了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000132:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f322ccb18242bb0096e168d90a7eec0d5bb1bae38e1e01a6a3f1c269fe6afe0",
      "text": "花园和榊还跟得上吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000134:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a81e0a33413df2a0f3cbc6d22896765357a0aaa9011660e141273cbb5744722",
      "text": "我在和大家聊过之后，\n觉得思念重要之人的心情\n都是一样的，所以，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000136:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd7a574a1966c6641543b20996f7b7e37e0cb82cbbbdc56559976147b8791ff9",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000138:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2bb5ca6503124514cdea240af4c5c5fdb3a2c1a5782f2e3ada6bdfa55238182e",
      "text": "我也没问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000140:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cadccf915d80cc449e368a745cf9a20f5aaa73e0b1d36f6ce6c9d2526b78822",
      "text": "多亏了大家，\n感觉能够好好努力了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000144:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:989251b2d20b5ec1917b545d6c6d3e26acfb759a65c59dff4cefa2dcf519616c",
      "text": "<emoji>image_talk_emoji_35</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000146:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e66e258e17d7f0fc99d1d2203d4a73eeeba63a6ed790634a948352779b8bb224",
      "text": "<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000148:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:838ead6adab65e08078277f14e512b8a281ff0e67cdff2320fc6024d0fc6b2fe",
      "text": "绘画出来",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_i:cmd-000150:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abb7c918c0c4fe404a002b50b40c41d5278e0bb4fcd69a84c6e5ffbbbbf8578",
      "text": "都筑先生，这是……？\n什么意思啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
